# Telegram Theme Switch — Telegram-style dark/light switch: tapping the moon/sun button
# snapshots the screen (makeImageFromView), flips the theme and reveals it through
# a Skia circular clip growing from the button while a Lottie icon plays; 4-tab bar.
# What this test covers: dark->light and light->dark; tapping again while the
# 1s reveal is running (must be ignored via isAnimating); rapid triple taps;
# every tab (only Search hosts the button) and toggling after returning to
# Search; a touch-down on the button that is dragged away (tap cancelled after
# the touch-down snapshot) followed by a tab change and a real toggle, so a
# stale pending snapshot would be revealed; ending back on the dark theme.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/telegram-theme-switch"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
wait 1500
press 352 719
wait 1800
press 352 719
wait 1800
# Re-tap mid-animation.
press 352 719
wait 300
press 352 719
wait 300
press 352 719
wait 1800
# Rapid taps.
press 352 719 --count 3
wait 2000
# Tabs: Home, Notifications, Message, back to Search.
press 50 817
wait 600
press 251 817
wait 600
press 352 817
wait 600
press 150 817
wait 800
press 352 719
wait 1800
# Cancelled tap (touch down, drag off), then switch tab and toggle.
gesture pan 352 719 -200 -300 500
wait 500
press 50 817
wait 600
press 150 817
wait 800
press 352 719
wait 1800
# Switch tabs while the reveal is running.
press 352 719
wait 200
press 50 817
wait 1500
press 150 817
wait 800
press 352 719
wait 1800
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
